# "For each opponent who can't": Bot2 has cards in hand but controls Tamiyo, Collector of Tales, so spells and abilities
# Bot1 controls can't make it discard (CR 101.2). Nothing is asked of Bot2 and nothing is discarded, so no Bat is made
# (it discarded no land), and Bot1 draws one card. Bot2 keeps Lightning Bolt, Island and the drawn Plains.
# Bot1's hand: 2 Swamps + the turn-3 draw + the Aclazotz draw = 4.

